! CP2K input template for ML initial-guess diagnostics.
!
! Same contract as benchmark_guess.inp.template, with two differences:
!
!   RUN_TYPE ENERGY   -- forces are not needed to ask why a guess is bad, and
!                        the second SCF they require would double the cost.
!   &AO_MATRICES      -- the point of this template. Printing the density every
!                        iteration is what lets ||P_guess - P_final|| and the
!                        residual path be measured instead of guessed at. It is
!                        O(nao^2) of text per iteration, so this template is for
!                        diagnosis only and never for timing.
!
! The SCF settings must otherwise match the benchmark exactly: a diagnosis of a
! run that converged differently explains a different run.

&GLOBAL
  PROJECT {{PROJECT}}
  RUN_TYPE ENERGY
  PRINT_LEVEL MEDIUM
&END GLOBAL
&FORCE_EVAL
  METHOD QUICKSTEP
  &DFT
    BASIS_SET_FILE_NAME BASIS_MOLOPT
    POTENTIAL_FILE_NAME POTENTIAL
    &SCF
      SCF_GUESS {{GUESS}}
      EPS_SCF 1.0E-6
      MAX_SCF 80
      &MIXING
        METHOD PULAY_MIXING
        ALPHA 0.4
        NBUFFER 8
      &END MIXING
    &END SCF
    &XC
      &XC_FUNCTIONAL PBE
      &END XC_FUNCTIONAL
    &END XC
    &MGRID
      CUTOFF 400
      REL_CUTOFF 50
    &END MGRID
    &PRINT
      &AO_MATRICES
        DENSITY .TRUE.
        OVERLAP .TRUE.
        NDIGITS 12
      &END AO_MATRICES
    &END PRINT
  &END DFT
  &SUBSYS
    &CELL
{{CELL}}
    &END CELL
    &COORD
{{COORD}}
    &END COORD
{{KIND}}
  &END SUBSYS
&END FORCE_EVAL
